{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6315 and F1 of 0.6068 suggest moderate performance, outperforming singleprofile multimodal baselines but underperforming RNA-only multiprofile configurations. The effectiveness of avgpool aggregation and concat fusion in this multimodal context remains uncertain, as does the relative contribution of image data in multiprofile settings."
}

